   "archetype": "The Caterpillar and Volvo of space",
   "philosophy": "Rugged, modular, repairable. Exposed truss spines, bolt-on pods, external tanks, floodlights and handholds. Every Daedalus can be stripped to the frame in a weekend and rebuilt as something else on Monday. If it breaks, you can see where, and you can reach it.",
